'''Chroma Deathshard''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 1]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Chroma Deathshard, unlike other knives, has a color-alternating split blade, meaning that its blade has been divided into two. Its guard with curved quillons appears to use Roblox’s [https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Black_Iron_(series) Black Iron] texture. The handle is black in color with a tape-like grip on it.

==Trivia==
*It is the [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] weapon [[Deathshard]], which can be found in the same box.
*It was released along with the [[Season 1]] update.
*This and [[Deathshard]]  have an similar throw animation as [[Fang]], [[Chroma Fang]] and [[Winter's Edge]].
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.
*This and [[Deathshard]] are the smallest [[Godly Weapons|godlies]] in [[Murder Mystery 2]].
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/62350856/Ghostfire-Dagger Ghostfire Dagger]. However, the guard is darker in color and the shadow aura has been removed. 

